    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⍉med = FDA-approved for cocaine use dx; a Cochrane review found low-level evidence for disulfiram added to psychosocial therapy, and ⍉evidence for anticonvulsants, DA agonists, antipsychotics or antidepressants."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
